@startuml
title Vehicle operating and degraded states
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam stateBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #171922
skinparam stateFontColor #F4F1E8

[*] --> Off
Off --> Booting : ignition / authorized wake
Booting --> Operational : rails, I/O, storage and recorder healthy
Booting --> FaultContained : required subsystem fault

state Operational {
  [*] --> Offline
  Offline --> Connected : WAN and services available
  Connected --> Offline : WAN / cloud loss
  Offline : Recording, local auth and I/O continue
  Connected : CAD, policy, health and evidence sync
}

Operational --> LowPower : voltage / thermal / UPS condition
LowPower --> Operational : recovery before shutdown threshold
LowPower --> ShuttingDown : reserve or temperature limit
Operational --> EvidenceProtection : event open / finalizing
EvidenceProtection --> Operational : durable seal complete
Operational --> FaultContained : subsystem failure
FaultContained --> Operational : approved recovery
Operational --> Service : authorized stationary service state
Service --> Operational : tests pass / service closes
Operational --> ShuttingDown : ignition off / authorized command
ShuttingDown --> Off : journals and storage finalized

note right of FaultContained
  Preserve independent healthy domains.
  Never imply failed recording is healthy.
end note
@enduml
